'''Wilderness Wail''' (密林の叫び, ''Mitsurin no Sakebi'', '''Cry of The Jungle''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 15.4 Update|Version 15.4]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
"Massive Damage" Effects Up (Sm): The effect of this ability is increased by 10%.

